OL,5,G1055 Inside the Tower of London
OL,6,     FThe fortress prepares to make
OL,7,     Fimportant changes to mark the new
OL,8,     FKing's reign. Preparations are
OL,9,     Falso made for the installation of
OL,10,     Fthe new Constable of the Tower.
OL,11,G1150 Inside the Tower of London
OL,12,     FBehind the walls for another
OL,13,     Fextraordinary year. It's March
OL,14,     F2023 and the Tower prepares for
OL,15,     Fone the most important events in
OL,16,     Fits 1000-year history - the
OL,17,     Fcrowning of a new monarch.
